  "info": {
    "title": "Moonrise Modular",
    "author": "Atomik",
    "notes": "A slow, spacious piece in A minor at 84 BPM built from the modular instruments: a pad that swells open on each chord, a deep drone, an arpeggio that climbs the seventh chords by itself, a sequenced pulse and a lead that wanders through the scale on its own, with a shimmering reverb and a ping-pong echo. The modular side: instruments made of containers with CV cables, a semi-modular synth with its sequencer, two send effects and a container macro moved by automation."
  },
